These patches change USCSandbox (https://github.com/nesrak1/USCSandbox), which has no license
file of its own and reworks code from AssetRipper, under the GNU General Public License version 3.
The patches are offered under the GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL-3.0), like the code
they modify, and are not covered by the MIT license of the rest of this repository.

The repository holds no USCSandbox code. The pipeline downloads USCSandbox at a pinned commit
(common.USCSANDBOX_COMMIT in tools/downgrade/common.py) and applies the patches on the machine that
builds (shader_rules.uscsandbox).
